{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23395","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和尝新酒 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和尝新酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空腹尝新酒，偶成卯时醉。\n醉来拥褐裘，直至斋时睡。\n睡酣不语笑，真寝无梦寐。\n殆欲妄形骸，讵知属天地。\n醒余和未散，起坐澹无事。\n举臂一欠伸，引琴弹秋思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}